{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"gate_softwood","model_identifier":"gate_softwood","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# gate_softwood\n\nWooden (softwood) gate, twice as wide in Patch 5: six columns (96 u) along X. Pale rope-lashed log posts with pointed tips, a log lintel topped with a row of stakes, and two plank leaves with bars, a diagonal brace, hinge straps and a drop-bar bracket. Opening 72 u wide x 90 u tall. Leaves hinged at the jambs (`leaf_l` at x -37, `leaf_r` at x +37) open inward (+Z). Clips `open` and `close`.\n\n- Footprint: 6 x 1 columns (96 x 16 units, 2.70 x 0.45 m), centred on the origin, front faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -48..49, y -3..129, z -8..6 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: finished 103, construction_0 32, construction_33 60, construction_66 75, ruined 55 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `gate_softwood_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- jambs: two 12 x 129 x 16 boxes at x -42 / +42\n- leaves (when closed): 72 x 92 x 4 at the origin; open leaves do not block\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `open` | 1.6 | once | leaves swing about 95 degrees inward (+Z) and hold open. |\n| `close` | 1.6 | once | leaves swing shut and hold. |\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -16)"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"log_post_l_f0#9a7a50","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-48,-2,-6],"to":[-43.8,116,-1],"autouv":0,"color":9,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[164,0,168,118],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[144,0,149,118],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[168,0,172,118],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[149,0,154,118],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[160,187,164,192],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[164,187,168,192],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"3ee160fd-b830-6a89-f1f1-433d90e6c3fa"},{"name":"log_tip_l_f0#9a7a50","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-47,115.5,-4.6],"to":[-44.8,121,-2.4],"autouv":0,"color":6,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[351,179,353,185],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[353,179,355,185],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[355,179,357,185],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[357,179,359,185],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[128,207,130,209],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[130,207,132,209],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"abb690f1-63ee-dbf1-e001-cbcdfda53c0e"},{"name":"log_post_l_b0#9a7a50","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-48,-1,0],"to":[-44,120,5],"autouv":0,"color":6,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[112,0,116,121],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[72,0,77,121],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[116,0,120,121],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[77,0,82,121],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[168,187,172,192],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[172,187,176,192],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"3e1f2c87-2a3b-16bb-713e-2fd4b2a7f800"},{"name":"log_tip_l_b0#9a7a50","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-47,119.5,1.6],"to":[-44.8,125,3.8],"autouv":0,"color":8,"origin":[0